PHP Photo Viewer

A super lightweight and retro-friendly PHP 5.4 photo viewer library
and website. Great for sharing your digicam photos with your friends
and family members, but also great if you want to use it as a library
and build your own image gallery website with it.

The goal of this project is to be extremely simple, all that you have
to do is create a folder named photos and drop your photos that you
want displayed there. You can organize them into folders, which
subsequently will become albums in the gallery. The thumbnails for
each photo will be generated automatically by the application and will
be stored in a folder named thumbs.

